 are cheaper than the equivalent raw materials bought from a shop, namely: bars are cheaper than buying ",["l","煤炭","coal"]," and the respective ores at the ",["l","铁匠铺","Blacksmith"],", and ",["l","木材","wood"]," ",["l","碎木机","chipped"]," from hardwood is cheaper than buying it from the ",["l","木匠的商店","Carpenter's Shop"]," in year 2+."]],[1,["Fishing ",["l","渔具","Tackle"]," can be deconstructed at any durability level. This allows certain tackle like ",["l","寻宝者","Treasure Hunter"]," and ",["l","陷阱浮标","Trap Bobber"]," to be refreshed at little to no cost."]],[1,["It is possible to repeatedly craft and deconstruct items like ",["l","宝箱","Chest"],"s, ",["l","楼梯","Staircase"],"s, ",["l","镂空火炬","Carved Brazier"],"s, or ",["l","骷髅火炬","Skull Brazier"],"s to \"collect\" resources for a ",["l","任务","Special Order"],"."]],[1,["If the ",["l","古代种子","Ancient Seed"]," artifact has not been found yet, one can deconstruct a packet of ",["l","上古种子","Ancient Seeds"]," obtained from a ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"]," to obtain the artifact so it can be donated."]],[1,["If an item's recipe was changed at some point (e.g., the ",["l","骷髅火炬","Skull Brazier"],"), the Deconstructor will return the highest value item based on the current recipe - it will not look back to see the materials originally used, even if the particular item was crafted before the recipe change."]],[2,["However, regardless of whether the player has ",["l","钓鱼","Trapper profession"],", ",["l","蟹笼","Crab Pot"]," would be deconstructed into 2 ",["l","铜锭","Copper Bars"],"."]],[1,[["l","雨水图腾","Rain Totem"],"s obtained from treasure rooms in the ",["l","骷髅洞穴","Skull Cavern"]," can be deconstructed into ",["l","松露油","Truffle Oil"]," to greatly increase the sell price from 20g to 1,065g, or 1,491g with the ",["l","耕种","Artisan Profession"],"."]],[1,["The ",["l","文字标牌","Text Sign"]," Pam places at the ",["l","巴士站","Bus Stop"]," on days she is unavailable can be collected and deconstructed into 25 ",["l","木材","Wood"],"."]]]]]